  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/120">
        <tei:head xml:lang="en">Psalm 120</tei:head>
        <tei:p><tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en">This Psalm deals with the evils of slander and deceit. David pleads with God to save him from those who use speech, not to express the truth, but to conceal it.</tei:note><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/1"/>A Song of Ascents.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/2"/>In my great distress I called to Adonoy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/3"/>and He answered me.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/4"/>Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/5"/>deliver my soul from lying lips,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/6"/>from a deceitful tongue.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/7"/>What will He give you
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/8"/>and what more will He add
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/9"/>to a deceitful tongue?
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/10"/>Sharp arrows of a warrior
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/11"/>with burning coals of a broom.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/12"/>Woe is me that I dwell in Meschech,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/13"/>that I reside among Kedar's tents.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/14"/>Too long has my soul dwelt
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/15"/>with those who hate peace.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/16"/>I am for peace;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/17"/>but when I speak
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/120/18"/>they are for war.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
